WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:00.900
Governor Ron DeSantis is

00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:02.502
likely entry into the Republican race

00:00:02.502 --> 00:00:03.136
for the presidency.

00:00:03.136 --> 00:00:03.570
Next week

00:00:03.570 --> 00:00:04.604
brings a renewed spotlight

00:00:04.604 --> 00:00:06.272
on what opponents called his Don't Say

00:00:06.272 --> 00:00:07.073
Gay law.

00:00:07.073 --> 00:00:08.575
It initially banned teacher

00:00:08.575 --> 00:00:09.609
teaching Florida students

00:00:09.609 --> 00:00:10.610
about sexual orientation

00:00:10.610 --> 00:00:11.444
and gender identity

00:00:11.444 --> 00:00:12.445
through the third grade.

00:00:12.445 --> 00:00:14.147
That's been expanded last month

00:00:14.147 --> 00:00:15.181
through high school.

00:00:15.181 --> 00:00:17.183
Opponents call it dangerous and vague.

00:00:17.550 --> 00:00:19.352
It's led to book bans that have included

00:00:19.352 --> 00:00:20.520
authors such as Toni

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:22.689
Morrison, Margaret Atwood and Judy Blume.

00:00:23.156 --> 00:00:24.691
It's part of an overall conservative

00:00:24.691 --> 00:00:28.228
push on education across the country.

00:00:28.228 --> 00:00:30.430
The state of Florida, we're proud

00:00:30.430 --> 00:00:31.064
to stand

00:00:31.064 --> 00:00:32.932
for education,

00:00:32.932 --> 00:00:35.535
not indoctrination in our schools.

00:00:35.568 --> 00:00:38.204
The left wing rioting and mayhem

00:00:38.204 --> 00:00:40.774
are the direct result of decades of left

00:00:40.774 --> 00:00:43.843
wing indoctrination in our schools.

00:00:43.877 --> 00:00:44.611
The Democrats

00:00:44.611 --> 00:00:45.678
believe that

00:00:45.678 --> 00:00:46.413
parents shouldn't

00:00:46.413 --> 00:00:49.049
have a say in their kids education.

00:00:49.082 --> 00:00:51.951
Parents want schools focused on reading,

00:00:52.118 --> 00:00:56.156
writing and math, not woke politics.

00:00:56.222 --> 00:00:58.224
The left is trying to hijack

00:00:58.224 --> 00:01:00.960
women's sports and our schools

00:01:01.861 --> 00:01:02.629
are on the verge

00:01:02.629 --> 00:01:04.664
of becoming breeding grounds for liberal

00:01:04.664 --> 00:01:06.032
and progressive ideas.

00:01:07.067 --> 00:01:07.967
The census law

00:01:07.967 --> 00:01:08.735
also led to

00:01:08.735 --> 00:01:10.136
his ongoing fight with Disney.

00:01:10.136 --> 00:01:11.805
One of the people he appointed to a board

00:01:11.805 --> 00:01:12.806
that was supposed to provide

00:01:12.806 --> 00:01:14.307
more oversight of Disney

00:01:14.307 --> 00:01:15.241
was the co-founder

00:01:15.241 --> 00:01:17.210
of a group called Moms for Liberty,

00:01:17.210 --> 00:01:18.678
which has advocated for these classroom

00:01:18.678 --> 00:01:19.245
fights in school

00:01:19.245 --> 00:01:20.547
districts across America.

00:01:20.547 --> 00:01:22.582
Ellie Reeve has more on who they are

00:01:24.851 --> 00:01:25.685
by exposing

00:01:25.685 --> 00:01:27.720
our children to adult concepts

00:01:27.887 --> 00:01:29.422
such as gender identity.

00:01:29.422 --> 00:01:31.291
We are asking them to carry a load

00:01:31.291 --> 00:01:33.460
that is much too heavy for them.

00:01:33.460 --> 00:01:35.995
Might I suggest instead of anal sex?

00:01:36.229 --> 00:01:37.464
Perhaps we could go back

00:01:37.464 --> 00:01:38.731
to teaching cursive?

00:01:38.731 --> 00:01:40.200
This book is not appropriate,

00:01:40.200 --> 00:01:42.602
and it is in your schools.

00:01:42.602 --> 00:01:43.536
Moms for Liberty

00:01:43.536 --> 00:01:45.004
is a parent activist group.

00:01:45.004 --> 00:01:46.773
It began in Florida in 20, 21

00:01:46.773 --> 00:01:47.941
to protest public schools

00:01:47.941 --> 00:01:50.176
being closed for COVID and mask mandates.

00:01:50.577 --> 00:01:52.679
The group became a frequent and spicy

00:01:52.679 --> 00:01:54.280
presence at school board meetings.

00:01:54.280 --> 00:01:56.316
This is about more than masks

00:01:56.316 --> 00:01:57.150
for the record.

00:01:58.118 --> 00:01:58.852
But now there are more

00:01:58.852 --> 00:02:01.020
than 250 Moms for Liberty chapters

00:02:01.020 --> 00:02:02.689
nationwide, the group says.

00:02:02.689 --> 00:02:04.424
And it has gained major conservative

00:02:04.424 --> 00:02:06.659
allies and morphed into something else

00:02:06.659 --> 00:02:07.260
a campaign

00:02:07.260 --> 00:02:07.961
against supposed

00:02:07.961 --> 00:02:09.295
indoctrination of children

00:02:09.295 --> 00:02:11.264
on race and sexuality.

00:02:11.264 --> 00:02:12.932
I have the right to say

00:02:12.932 --> 00:02:15.235
I don't want my kids to learn this.

00:02:15.235 --> 00:02:17.570
I don't agree with this movement,

00:02:17.570 --> 00:02:19.639
and that's my rights.

00:02:19.639 --> 00:02:20.273
So books

00:02:20.273 --> 00:02:23.343
should fall into that category as well.

00:02:23.343 --> 00:02:24.277
We wanted to understand

00:02:24.277 --> 00:02:24.844
what's driving

00:02:24.844 --> 00:02:26.146
these moms on a deeper level

00:02:26.146 --> 00:02:27.614
