What Moms for

00:02:44.831 --> 00:02:46.366
Liberty has become most famous

00:02:46.366 --> 00:02:47.567
for is claiming school

00:02:47.567 --> 00:02:48.735
libraries contain books

00:02:48.735 --> 00:02:50.503
with pornographic content

00:02:50.503 --> 00:02:52.872
and for trying to get some books removed.

00:02:52.872 --> 00:02:54.073
Some of those books listed

00:02:54.073 --> 00:02:55.575
do talk about sex,

00:02:55.575 --> 00:02:57.043
but according to the Supreme Court's

00:02:57.043 --> 00:02:58.378
definition of obscenity,

00:02:58.378 --> 00:02:59.512
they're not porn.

00:02:59.512 --> 00:03:01.080
I've read a lot of criticism

00:03:01.080 --> 00:03:02.115
