00:03:10.323 --> 00:03:12.892
We're not looking to to ban books.

00:03:12.892 --> 00:03:14.761
We're not looking to burn books.

00:03:14.761 --> 00:03:16.963
We just need to get back to a system

00:03:16.963 --> 00:03:18.331
